WEBVTT

00:00:10.152 --> 00:00:11.420
-Actually, we...

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.911
-Actually, we...
-We have to return to the fairy world.

00:00:14.123 --> 00:00:17.456
What? Wh-Why? How come?

00:00:19.428 --> 00:00:23.489
Your flowers are blooming.
You both found a "Twinkle".

00:00:23.599 --> 00:00:25.401
-See you. We'll be waiting for you!

00:00:25.401 --> 00:00:27.096
-See you. We'll be waiting for you!
-Take care, Sugar!

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:30.034
I'll catch up to you soon, ok?

00:00:30.139 --> 00:00:32.972
Take care, you guys!

00:00:33.075 --> 00:00:35.373
Good-bye!

00:00:39.916 --> 00:00:41.577
The flower...

00:00:43.052 --> 00:00:46.681
Huh? I feel kind of...

00:00:52.495 --> 00:00:53.985
Sugar.

00:00:56.065 --> 00:00:57.726
She isn't home yet?

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:05.469
When she gets home, I have to tell her
not to come to the store anymore.

00:01:09.278 --> 00:01:10.643
Sugar.

00:01:13.082 --> 00:01:14.982
You'll catch cold
if you sleep here.

00:01:16.185 --> 00:01:17.447
Sugar.

00:01:18.421 --> 00:01:19.854
Hey, Sugar.

00:01:23.492 --> 00:01:25.483
Sugar?

00:01:26.329 --> 00:01:28.388
Sugar! Sugar!

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:32.702
What's wrong?
Come on, wake up!

00:01:32.702 --> 00:01:34.363
Sugar!

00:01:34.937 --> 00:01:38.607
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:38.607 --> 00:01:41.610
Kuchibiru ni

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:46.547
Namida no rouge...

00:02:06.302 --> 00:02:09.839
Sugar Baby Love

00:02:09.839 --> 00:02:17.143
Ai nante, shiritaku naiwa.

00:02:20.683 --> 00:02:24.086
Sugar Baby Love

00:02:24.086 --> 00:02:27.289
Kuchibiru ni

00:02:27.289 --> 00:02:30.725
Namida no rouge...

00:02:35.031 --> 00:02:38.768
Mokuyou ni

00:02:38.768 --> 00:02:41.637
Bara o kai,

00:02:41.637 --> 00:02:45.869
Tegami o soete.

00:02:49.412 --> 00:02:53.215
Sugar Baby Love

00:02:53.215 --> 00:02:55.985
Yume de au.

00:02:55.985 --> 00:03:01.082
Anata wa yasashii...

00:03:05.561 --> 00:03:08.029
Hey, what's wrong, Sugar?

00:03:09.732 --> 00:03:11.333
Are you asleep, Sugar?

00:03:11.333 --> 00:03:13.324
Sugar? Sugar!

00:03:15.137 --> 00:03:17.537
Oh, Saga.

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:21.343
Don't "Oh, Saga" me.
Why are you sleeping here?

00:03:21.343 --> 00:03:26.042
Now, don't make a face,
because I'm fine...

00:03:30.086 --> 00:03:32.418
Sugar, are you sick?

00:03:33.923 --> 00:03:35.858
I'm just a little tired.

00:03:35.858 --> 00:03:40.318
Anyway, I'm sorry about today.
I won't goof up next time.

00:03:41.564 --> 00:03:44.556
I'll be a good helper.

00:03:55.811 --> 00:03:57.540
A fairy sickness?

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.780
What's this all of a sudden?

00:03:59.982 --> 00:04:02.974
Uh, well, we were talking
about it at school today.

00:04:03.085 --> 00:04:06.288
We were wondering if fairies
and stuff like that get sick, too.

00:04:06.288 --> 00:04:08.624
Hey, what do you
think, Grandma?

00:04:08.624 --> 00:04:12.458
Well, I'm not an expert,
so I don't really know.

00:04:13.195 --> 00:04:13.820
Oh.

00:04:16.699 --> 00:04:17.867
-But...

00:04:17.867 --> 00:04:18.731
-But...
-But?

00:04:18.968 --> 00:04:21.804
A long time ago,
I read about fairies in a book.

00:04:21.804 --> 00:04:24.306
It said when a fairy's human
companion becomes unhappy or sick,

00:04:24.306 --> 00:04:26.399
the fairy also becomes sick.

00:04:26.642 --> 00:04:29.270
A fairy's human companion?

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:39.720
That can't be it, can it?

00:04:50.933 --> 00:04:52.332
No!!!

00:04:52.768 --> 00:04:54.030
What is it?

00:04:54.336 --> 00:04:57.206
Uh... I'm sorry!

00:04:57.206 --> 00:04:57.968
-Saga!
-Saga!

00:04:58.073 --> 00:05:01.736
Honestly! This is my piano!

00:05:02.311 --> 00:05:04.871
It's my choice
what I do with it!

00:05:13.455 --> 00:05:15.116
We're home, Greta!

00:05:17.092 --> 00:05:19.728
You're finally going to play
the piano for me today, right?

00:05:19.728 --> 00:05:21.355
F-Father.

00:05:21.463 --> 00:05:25.331
Come on, give Daddy
a wonderful performance.

00:05:25.434 --> 00:05:29.004
Oh, no. It would be far too
embarrassing to play the piano

00:05:29.004 --> 00:05:31.905
with my hair in
such a mess.

00:05:32.007 --> 00:05:35.033
Father, I'm going
to take a bath.

00:05:38.647 --> 00:05:41.350
Greta, have you taken
an aversion to your father?

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:44.717
She's just shy. She'll play it
for you one of these days.

00:05:46.755 --> 00:05:49.451
Yes. I'll be waiting, Greta!

00:05:57.466 --> 00:06:02.403
Why do I have to go around
worrying like this? This is...

00:06:06.141 --> 00:06:07.631
Miss Saga.

00:06:09.845 --> 00:06:11.403
See you later!

00:06:20.155 --> 00:06:23.488
Saga, play the piano.

00:06:30.766 --> 00:06:33.469
Let's see. Today I have to
organize the Little Me's cellar,

00:06:33.469 --> 00:06:39.430
clean the siphon before the
customers come, and I also have to...

00:06:44.446 --> 00:06:47.283
Hey, Saga? Listen...

00:06:47.283 --> 00:06:49.376
I'm sorry!
I wasn't listening.

00:06:50.419 --> 00:06:54.355
Oh, come on, Saga.
I haven't said anything yet.

00:06:54.456 --> 00:06:58.449
We were wondering if you'd like to go
somewhere after school, if you're free.

00:06:59.228 --> 00:07:01.458
I'm sorry. I can't today, either.

00:07:02.765 --> 00:07:04.426
Then what about tomorrow?

00:07:04.533 --> 00:07:08.663
Um, um... I'm sorry. I have to go
right after school tomorrow, too.

00:07:08.771 --> 00:07:12.468
Oh, my, Miss Saga.
You seem to be very busy.

00:07:13.208 --> 00:07:14.368
Greta.

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:15.677
Oh!

00:07:15.778 --> 00:07:20.647
Perhaps you will find me a formidable
adversary, for I am No. 1 in the class.

00:07:21.283 --> 00:07:25.083
And with that,
I challenge you, Miss Saga!

00:07:26.155 --> 00:07:27.189
-S-Saga?

00:07:27.189 --> 00:07:27.985
-S-Saga?
-Saga!

00:07:28.324 --> 00:07:30.893
Let's see. Today's rain is...

00:07:30.893 --> 00:07:32.053
Ginger!

00:07:33.228 --> 00:07:34.092
Saga.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:35.727
I need to ask you something!

00:07:36.432 --> 00:07:37.990
Sugar is sick!

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.735
What's wrong with her?

00:07:39.735 --> 00:07:41.770
I have no idea.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:44.432
Please tell me
what to do, Ginger.

00:07:45.841 --> 00:07:48.241
Sugar is sick? I see.

00:07:48.777 --> 00:07:49.539
Ginger?

00:07:51.714 --> 00:07:55.241
Saga, Salt and Pepper's
Magic Flowers have bloomed.

00:07:55.884 --> 00:07:56.543
What?

00:07:56.652 --> 00:07:58.787
They both completed their
training in the human world,

00:07:58.787 --> 00:08:02.723
and they have returned to
the fairy world. That is our law.

00:08:03.625 --> 00:08:06.729
Now that you mention it,
I haven't seen them around.

00:08:06.729 --> 00:08:09.231
So, Salt and Pepper are gone.

00:08:09.231 --> 00:08:11.300
But Sugar never mentioned
a word of it to me...

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.666
If she had told you,
would you have listened?

00:08:18.006 --> 00:08:18.741
-What is this?

00:08:18.741 --> 00:08:22.939
-What is this?
-Uh, listen. I tried to shut the lid, and...

00:08:23.712 --> 00:08:27.808
I-I'm sorry.
I wanted to help you.

00:08:28.484 --> 00:08:30.475
Please don't try to help.

00:08:33.822 --> 00:08:35.119
Stay away!!

00:08:36.759 --> 00:08:38.522
But I was...

00:08:39.528 --> 00:08:43.089
I thought you, of all people,
would appreciate her!

00:08:53.208 --> 00:08:56.109
You might think so,
but I can't do anything.

00:09:06.588 --> 00:09:10.752
Don't even think of trying to get
sympathy by catching a cold like before.

00:09:10.859 --> 00:09:12.850
Now, I challenge you, Miss Saga.

00:09:13.462 --> 00:09:17.032
Lf, by chance,
you should happen to defeat me,

00:09:17.032 --> 00:09:19.364
I will have no choice
but to return your piano.

00:09:19.468 --> 00:09:21.459
I'm a bit busy right now, Greta.

00:09:23.105 --> 00:09:24.936
Miss Saga.

00:09:26.475 --> 00:09:28.310
Don't run from me.

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:29.174
Greta?

00:09:29.578 --> 00:09:31.978
Do you intend to keep
running from me forever?

00:09:34.149 --> 00:09:38.120
Ever since we first met,
you have been my rival.

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:40.722
If you consider yourself my rival,
keep your chest held high!

00:09:40.722 --> 00:09:43.953
You are no longer the girl
I accepted as my rival!

00:09:49.765 --> 00:09:51.289
Miss Saga...

00:09:52.601 --> 00:09:54.592
I'm sorry, Greta.

00:09:57.339 --> 00:10:00.342
Honestly! I don't care anymore!

00:10:00.342 --> 00:10:02.367
I truly and honestly
don't care anymore!

00:10:09.117 --> 00:10:11.085
Let's see.

00:10:11.186 --> 00:10:14.587
Saga is at her part-time job
at Little Me again today.

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:18.820
So, how many more days will it
be until the piano comes back?

00:10:18.927 --> 00:10:21.122
Let's see, um...

00:10:23.465 --> 00:10:24.955
I have no idea.

00:10:25.734 --> 00:10:28.396
I hope it comes back soon.

00:10:28.504 --> 00:10:32.074
Then Saga will smile
like she used to.

00:10:32.074 --> 00:10:35.703
Then everything will
be back to normal.

00:10:35.811 --> 00:10:40.407
I would be able to hear her play again,
and Salt and Pepper would be there, too.

00:10:50.392 --> 00:10:54.351
I have to catch up and become a
full-fledged Season Fairy like them, too.

00:10:54.963 --> 00:10:58.057
I'm going to make pretty
snow fall, like Mommy does.

00:11:12.881 --> 00:11:15.406
Huh? I can't make snow.

00:11:25.761 --> 00:11:28.025
I have to practice hard, too.

00:11:30.499 --> 00:11:32.626
Right, Saga?

00:11:51.186 --> 00:11:55.350
It throws me off, not having
their cheerful voices around.

00:12:05.834 --> 00:12:08.496
Well, see you
tomorrow, Anne, Norma.

00:12:10.439 --> 00:12:11.974
They already left?

00:12:11.974 --> 00:12:14.738
Hey, hurry up,
you guys! Hurry!

00:12:14.843 --> 00:12:16.333
Oh, Phil.

00:12:16.445 --> 00:12:18.879
-Let's go.
-Yeah.

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:26.622
-Huh? It's you guys.

00:12:26.622 --> 00:12:28.453
-Huh? It's you guys.
-Were you called out, too?

00:12:28.824 --> 00:12:31.156
Yeah. You guys, too?

00:12:34.129 --> 00:12:36.757
Did I keep you waiting, everyone?

00:12:36.865 --> 00:12:39.935
What's this about, Greta? Why have
you called us out here in secret?

00:12:39.935 --> 00:12:42.571
We have an important
experiment to attend to!

00:12:42.571 --> 00:12:46.308
There is but one reason I have
summoned you all here today.

00:12:46.308 --> 00:12:48.677
I actually have something
important to discuss with you.

00:12:48.677 --> 00:12:50.269
Something important?

00:12:50.779 --> 00:12:51.302
Yes...

00:12:54.583 --> 00:12:55.948
I'm sorry!

00:12:56.718 --> 00:13:00.210
You don't have to rush
around so much. Take your time.

00:13:00.689 --> 00:13:04.090
I can't. I have a
full schedule today.

00:13:09.931 --> 00:13:11.922
I'm sorry, Mr. Luchino.

00:13:12.267 --> 00:13:15.430
Don't worry about it.
I'll just buy some new ones.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:21.977
What's wrong, anyway? You don't
usually make so many mistakes.

00:13:21.977 --> 00:13:24.207
Are you worried
about something, Saga?

00:13:25.781 --> 00:13:28.483
It said that when a fairy's human
companion becomes unhappy or sick

00:13:28.483 --> 00:13:30.952
the fairy also
becomes sick.

00:13:30.952 --> 00:13:34.911
I thought you of all people
would appreciate her!

00:13:35.123 --> 00:13:37.318
Do you intend to keep
running from me forever?

00:13:41.063 --> 00:13:43.265
No, I'm not worried about
anything. I'm totally fine.

00:13:43.265 --> 00:13:47.668
Really? Ok, then.
So, break time!

00:13:48.804 --> 00:13:50.465
Don't give me a hard time.

00:13:51.673 --> 00:13:53.163
Ok, ok.

00:14:04.152 --> 00:14:05.813
Um, Mr. Luchino!

00:14:07.255 --> 00:14:11.226
I remembered something important
I have to do. May I please leave early?

00:14:11.226 --> 00:14:15.094
Huh? Oh, sure.
But that's not like you.

00:14:16.231 --> 00:14:18.392
I'm sorry for being selfish.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.263
That's not what I meant.

00:14:20.936 --> 00:14:23.271
It's important, right?
Go ahead, Saga.

00:14:23.271 --> 00:14:24.863
Huh? Uh, right!

00:14:25.974 --> 00:14:27.843
See you later, Mr. Luchino!

00:14:27.843 --> 00:14:31.176
So, Saga has learned to
be selfish. Good for her!

00:14:35.117 --> 00:14:38.416
Elder might know something
about Sugar's illness.

00:14:44.159 --> 00:14:47.929
-What? Give the piano to Saga?
-What? Give the piano to Saga?

00:14:47.929 --> 00:14:50.799
Precisely. Fortunately,
Sunday, the day after tomorrow,

00:14:50.799 --> 00:14:53.233
my mother and father
are both going out.

00:14:53.969 --> 00:14:56.995
That will be the perfect
opportunity to move the piano.

00:14:57.105 --> 00:14:58.538
Are you saying...

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:00.601
That behind your
parents' backs...

00:15:00.809 --> 00:15:02.800
You want to return
the piano to Saga?

00:15:03.178 --> 00:15:05.942
Oh, dear!
You've got the wrong idea.

00:15:06.047 --> 00:15:10.752
That is my piano, so where I
choose to put it is my choice.

00:15:10.752 --> 00:15:13.220
Even if that happens
to be Saga's house.

00:15:14.523 --> 00:15:16.184
What ridiculous logic.

00:15:17.459 --> 00:15:18.448
Anne?

00:15:19.427 --> 00:15:23.498
In the end, we're all the same.
We all love Saga.

00:15:23.498 --> 00:15:25.295
Right, Greta?

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.335
I merely...

00:15:27.335 --> 00:15:32.363
As a rival, I do not take any pleasure
defeating Saga while she is unhappy!

00:15:32.674 --> 00:15:34.437
That's all there is to it.

00:15:34.976 --> 00:15:38.377
The question is,
how do we move the piano?

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:41.049
This seems more interesting
than the usual experiments!

00:15:41.049 --> 00:15:43.018
We've got high hopes, Phil.

00:15:43.018 --> 00:15:45.111
Yeah!
Leave everything to me!

00:15:45.787 --> 00:15:49.357
Hey, why are you taking command?
I'm the idea person here.

00:15:49.357 --> 00:15:51.348
This requires precise planning.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.329
Strategy meeting at the
secret base immediately!

00:15:54.329 --> 00:15:57.127
-Yeah!
-I'm telling you not to ignore me!

00:16:04.472 --> 00:16:06.641
I wonder where Elder went?

00:16:06.641 --> 00:16:09.132
I'm sure he flew
through here.

00:16:10.078 --> 00:16:11.980
No! More! More!

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:12.969
Elder?

00:16:15.116 --> 00:16:19.955
When Ginger is tired from work, I will
bring her a present of sweet waffles!

00:16:19.955 --> 00:16:24.289
Then we'll have a sweet, sweet
moment together. How great!

00:16:24.926 --> 00:16:27.656
Give me more waffles!
Please, please!

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:33.160
Elder, I need to ask you something!
Something is wrong with Sugar!

00:16:34.736 --> 00:16:36.704
No! No!

00:16:36.805 --> 00:16:40.434
This is a present for Ginger!

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:46.306
He left...

00:16:50.585 --> 00:16:51.916
Waffles?

00:16:55.257 --> 00:16:58.827
Hey, Saga?
What's this called? Huh, huh?

00:16:58.827 --> 00:17:00.192
It's a waffle.

00:17:00.762 --> 00:17:01.990
"Waffo"?

00:17:03.732 --> 00:17:05.962
Maybe I'll buy her a present.

00:17:07.135 --> 00:17:10.372
Excuse me. I'd like a
strawberry, a choco-banana,

00:17:10.372 --> 00:17:12.431
and a milk cream, please.

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:13.768
Coming right up.

00:17:15.777 --> 00:17:16.903
Here.

00:17:19.748 --> 00:17:21.010
What's this?

00:17:21.116 --> 00:17:23.209
It's a freebie, because
you're a regular customer.

00:17:27.455 --> 00:17:28.945
Thank you!

00:17:31.259 --> 00:17:33.750
So it may be you after all.

00:17:33.862 --> 00:17:38.128
You may, indeed, be the biggest
"Twinkle" for Sugar. Eh, Saga?

00:17:38.833 --> 00:17:40.335
Oh, Saga!

00:17:40.335 --> 00:17:43.905
We've developed
new combination magic!

00:17:43.905 --> 00:17:45.702
We'll let you have a peek.

00:17:46.708 --> 00:17:48.576
Hmph. What a bore.

00:17:48.576 --> 00:17:51.204
Aren't we being
ignored a lot lately?

00:17:53.982 --> 00:17:54.816
-I'm home!

00:17:54.816 --> 00:17:56.147
-I'm home!
-Hello, Saga.

00:17:57.052 --> 00:18:00.488
I'm home, Sugar.
I have a present, see?

00:18:02.891 --> 00:18:04.051
Sugar!

00:18:07.495 --> 00:18:09.963
Oh, Saga.
Welcome home.

00:18:11.466 --> 00:18:13.802
I was writing you a letter,

00:18:13.802 --> 00:18:16.304
because you're busy
at your part-time job.

00:18:16.304 --> 00:18:19.467
I never know when
you'll be home. That's why.

00:18:20.308 --> 00:18:21.798
A letter?

00:18:23.011 --> 00:18:26.469
It says "You can do it, Saga.
I'll keep trying, too."

00:18:28.316 --> 00:18:32.053
But I only got halfway.

00:18:32.053 --> 00:18:35.682
Saga. You came home so soon...

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:40.550
Sugar.

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:04.109
It's kind of lonely.

00:19:05.453 --> 00:19:08.422
I'm sorry.
You've been lonely, haven't you?

00:19:09.624 --> 00:19:12.650
I was only thinking of myself.

00:19:12.761 --> 00:19:14.251
Saga...

00:19:14.963 --> 00:19:17.295
I'm sorry, Sugar.

00:19:26.941 --> 00:19:30.707
Come to think of it, I forgot.
I haven't played it all this time.

00:20:56.431 --> 00:20:58.023
The Magic Flower!

00:20:59.601 --> 00:21:00.761
Saga!

00:21:03.138 --> 00:21:05.163
Good morning, Saga!

00:21:06.107 --> 00:21:06.975
Sugar!

00:21:06.975 --> 00:21:09.068
Huh? Is it nighttime already?

00:21:10.445 --> 00:21:12.436
I guess it's not
"good morning."

00:21:13.781 --> 00:21:15.646
You're squishing me, Saga.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:19.320
Why, Sugar?
Aren't you still sick?

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:22.084
Huh? Sick?
What?

00:21:23.725 --> 00:21:26.558
You know what?
I had a dream about you.

00:21:26.661 --> 00:21:27.228
-A dream?

00:21:27.228 --> 00:21:27.996
-A dream?
-Yeah.

00:21:27.996 --> 00:21:31.332
Everyone was listening
to you play the piano.

00:21:31.332 --> 00:21:34.028
And then,
you looked so gentle!

